WEBVTT

00:00.910 --> 00:06.200
Next week, we'll be having a music festival!

00:06.520 --> 00:09.240
Yet another event that comes out of nowhere.

00:09.610 --> 00:13.490
Roswaal-sensei, what's wrong with you?

00:13.490 --> 00:15.780
Yeah! Tell him, Aqua!

00:15.780 --> 00:18.080
Why right now?

00:18.080 --> 00:19.330
Yup, yup!

00:19.330 --> 00:22.510
You don't understand how
serious the situation is!

00:22.510 --> 00:23.500
Yup, yup!

00:23.970 --> 00:26.660
You can't get ready for a
music festival in a week!

00:26.660 --> 00:28.770
You need a month, minimum!

00:29.430 --> 00:31.710
That wasn't what I meant.

00:31.710 --> 00:37.090
I should mention that the 
winning class will receive a prize.

00:37.090 --> 00:38.050
Yup.

00:42.410 --> 00:43.990
Th-That's...

00:44.540 --> 00:46.350
Huh? What is that?

00:47.020 --> 00:52.000
EPISODE 9: GET CLOSER! MUSIC FESTIVAL

00:47.640 --> 00:52.580
If we press that button, we can
go back to our own world?

00:52.580 --> 00:54.260
If it's real.

00:54.260 --> 01:00.060
A similar button is what brought
us here in the first place.

01:00.060 --> 01:01.570
Huh? Really?

01:02.160 --> 01:04.660
I don't remember pushing one.

01:04.660 --> 01:07.830
Maybe somebody pushed it
and you just didn't notice.

01:07.830 --> 01:11.470
Probably Roswaal, then. That jerk.

01:11.470 --> 01:12.700
More importantly...

01:14.670 --> 01:16.140
We have visitors.

01:17.820 --> 01:20.600
Oh, Alpha-dono!

01:20.830 --> 01:22.060
Is something wrong?

01:22.830 --> 01:27.190
Tanya, I can't believe you
serve the Cult of Diablos.

01:28.460 --> 01:30.840
I serve the Cult of Diablos?

01:31.790 --> 01:33.980
A devil wearing the skin of a little girl.

01:34.550 --> 01:36.190
Tanya von Degurechaff.

01:36.190 --> 01:39.990
Wait, where do you get off calling me a devil?

01:39.990 --> 01:42.550
Pandora's Actor-sensei told us!

01:42.910 --> 01:46.250
Pandora's Actor-sensei?

01:46.250 --> 01:48.330
What kind of joke is this?

01:48.330 --> 01:50.100
It's no joke.

01:50.100 --> 01:54.570
We've investigated and found that all of
Class 2's students, including you, are devils.

01:54.570 --> 01:56.090
Us, too?

01:56.090 --> 02:01.890
And your leader is Ains Ooal Gown, 
the Ruler of Darkness.

02:03.720 --> 02:06.110
Um, "Ruler of Darkness" is...

02:05.220 --> 02:07.340
You are evil incarnate!

02:09.650 --> 02:13.610
Alpha-dono, I think that's enough slander.

02:13.610 --> 02:16.240
We have no idea what you're talking about.

02:16.500 --> 02:22.830
You can play dumb if you like, 
but you're still clearly our enemies.

02:24.290 --> 02:25.870
Enemies, huh?

02:27.080 --> 02:28.830
<i>The way they get attached
to their weird ideas</i>

02:28.830 --> 02:30.950
<i>reminds me of certain other people.</i>

02:31.310 --> 02:37.170
A civilized person would try 
diplomatic solutions before violence,

02:37.420 --> 02:40.550
but you can't even use violence in this world.

02:40.550 --> 02:41.620
That's right.

02:42.170 --> 02:47.070
So we'll destroy your plans with another method.

02:47.070 --> 02:48.650
Another method?

02:48.650 --> 02:53.470
The class that wins next week's music
festival will get a prize, right?

02:54.130 --> 02:55.070
Do you mean...

02:55.300 --> 02:58.680
An artifact that enables you
to return to your own world.

02:59.150 --> 03:04.110
We, Class 1, will win, 
and return to our own world.

03:04.420 --> 03:05.420
And...

03:06.050 --> 03:08.850
We will seal you in this world!

03:10.830 --> 03:12.620
Be prepared.

03:17.870 --> 03:21.090
Guess we've got enemies now.

03:21.090 --> 03:24.660
They don't want to let us go home?

03:24.660 --> 03:27.780
Just so we're clear, it's 'cause
you look like a spooky skeleton.

03:27.780 --> 03:30.060
Yeah, can't deny that.

03:30.380 --> 03:34.360
Well, if they're calling
 someone like me a devil,

03:34.360 --> 03:36.360
there's not much point 
in negotiating with them.

03:36.840 --> 03:41.000
I'm rather upset with 
Pandora's Actor-sensei, though.

03:41.000 --> 03:44.280
I'll have to have Rerugen-sensei
give him a good talking-to.

03:44.740 --> 03:48.130
What if Rerugen-sensei is
 saying the same thing?

03:49.260 --> 03:51.980
You're so funny, Kazuma.

03:53.740 --> 03:58.460
We can't let Class 2 beat us
in the music festival, okay?

03:58.460 --> 04:02.970
Yes. I've done a complete
investigation of their fighting force.

04:03.460 --> 04:05.300
Please look at these documents.

04:06.680 --> 04:08.600
Wow, you're so into this!

04:08.600 --> 04:10.550
I like that!

04:10.940 --> 04:12.770
Look at all this.

04:12.770 --> 04:15.230
Their class rep is Emilia.

04:15.700 --> 04:21.800
But they're actually led by the Ruler of the
Darkness, an undead named Ains Ooal Gown.

04:22.460 --> 04:24.490
Ruler of the Darkness?

04:25.070 --> 04:29.410
And he has three devils supporting him.

04:30.150 --> 04:31.220
Demiurge.

04:31.220 --> 04:32.140
Albedo.

04:32.140 --> 04:34.460
And Tanya von Degurechaff.

04:34.460 --> 04:36.670
Tanya's a devil?

04:36.670 --> 04:37.590
Yes.

04:37.590 --> 04:41.290
She's wearing the skin of a young girl.

04:41.290 --> 04:43.750
That's a figure of speech.

04:44.200 --> 04:46.420
Oh, it's just a figure of speech.

04:46.420 --> 04:47.510
Whew.

04:47.510 --> 04:52.180
Anyway, none of them are to be underestimated.

04:47.510 --> 04:55.960
AINS OOAL GOWN
DEMIURGE                       ALBEDO
TANYA VON DEGURECHAFF

04:52.180 --> 04:55.200
And so we will form our plans
around dealing with them.

04:55.200 --> 04:56.030
A moment.

04:58.030 --> 04:59.190
Um, and you are...

05:01.640 --> 05:03.540
Julius Juukulius.

05:04.090 --> 05:09.370
Yes, Class 2 has many powerful members
like Ains-kun and lady Tanya,

05:09.370 --> 05:12.940
but there are others we must be wary of.

05:13.330 --> 05:15.580
Who do you mean?

05:15.580 --> 05:17.010
Natsuki Subaru.

05:15.850 --> 05:20.880
NATSUKI SUBARU
HAS A NASTY GLARE

05:17.340 --> 05:20.880
I believe he is the greatest threat.

05:21.240 --> 05:24.630
Gotta watch out for Satou Kazuma, too.

05:21.730 --> 05:24.630
KAZUMA

05:24.630 --> 05:28.900
I investigated them, too...

05:28.900 --> 05:32.350
But they only seem to have ordinary abilities.

05:32.350 --> 05:35.650
Well, their abilities aren't all they've got.

05:35.650 --> 05:37.280
They can be unnervingly clever.

05:37.280 --> 05:41.070
They'll do things you'd 
never anticipate, right?

05:41.070 --> 05:42.790
Yes, that's it!

05:42.790 --> 05:47.400
You can't understand out their
strength just by looking at them.

05:47.400 --> 05:49.150
I see.

05:49.150 --> 05:52.330
So we'll watch out for them, too.

05:52.330 --> 05:57.790
Well, we'll win the music festival, 
no matter who we up against.

05:57.790 --> 06:01.990
Yup! We're fine as long as
we have the boss on our side!

05:57.790 --> 06:02.810
DON QUIXOTE GOES TO THE SOUTH POLE

06:02.340 --> 06:04.440
I like the way you talk!

06:03.270 --> 06:06.630
<i>A music festival, huh?</i>

06:07.170 --> 06:11.400
<i>Normally, I'd just ignore an event
like this and avoid attention,</i>

06:11.400 --> 06:16.130
<i>but as Eminence in Shadow,
I want to do something cool!</i>

06:16.480 --> 06:21.820
MUSIC ROOM

06:17.980 --> 06:21.810
Okay, here are your parts for the performance.

06:22.290 --> 06:25.480
Why must I play the piano?

06:25.480 --> 06:27.450
You can do it, Cocytus!

06:29.170 --> 06:31.570
What's wrong, Otto-dono?

06:31.570 --> 06:36.250
Do I really have to conduct these people?

06:31.570 --> 06:36.250
PART ASSIGNMENTS

06:36.250 --> 06:39.090
What do you mean, "these people"?

06:39.090 --> 06:40.610
All of you!

06:40.610 --> 06:44.740
Otto, stop complaining about a fair drawing.

06:44.740 --> 06:46.540
I-Incredible.

06:46.930 --> 06:51.580
Albedo-san isn't going to be with
Ains-san, and she's not complaining!

06:51.580 --> 06:55.860
That's because I got her
to agree by telling her

06:54.040 --> 06:56.950
I don't have any bard skills.

06:55.860 --> 06:58.700
she could give Ains-sama 
private lessons on his instrument.

06:56.950 --> 07:01.800
Don't worry, Ains-sama.
I'll teach you everything!

07:01.800 --> 07:03.080
L-Like this?

07:03.080 --> 07:04.460
Like that!

07:04.460 --> 07:07.090
Aren't you a little too close?

07:09.750 --> 07:12.110
A word, everyone, if I may.

07:13.400 --> 07:14.820
What is it, Tanya?

07:15.410 --> 07:17.780
I want to confirm one thing.

07:22.300 --> 07:27.550
Do you all really want to go home?

07:28.140 --> 07:30.760
Tanya, what does that mean?

07:31.020 --> 07:33.170
Emilia-san, we...

07:35.690 --> 07:39.710
Our original world was in the
midst of a horrible war.

07:40.100 --> 07:44.660
We could have died at any moment.

07:45.310 --> 07:49.070
To be honest, the war was not going well.

07:49.310 --> 07:50.580
Really?

07:50.580 --> 07:51.360
Yeah.

07:51.360 --> 07:52.450
Really?

07:53.090 --> 07:57.560
But still, we must return.

07:57.970 --> 08:01.790
I may not mind this world so much...

08:02.200 --> 08:04.870
But that's still our problem to solve.

08:06.700 --> 08:09.330
So let me ask you all...

08:09.940 --> 08:13.540
Do you want to go back?

08:14.260 --> 08:18.410
We have to defeat the Demon King!

08:18.410 --> 08:19.220
Right, Aqua?

08:20.190 --> 08:22.920
You were still planning on
fighting the Devil King?

08:23.950 --> 08:27.730
I mean, I'm like, does it really matter?

08:28.010 --> 08:28.910
I get it.

08:28.910 --> 08:31.150
Wait, not you too, Kazuma!

08:31.150 --> 08:35.530
I never cared about the
Devil King to begin with.

08:35.530 --> 08:38.120
This world's pretty cozy, I think.

08:38.490 --> 08:43.500
I was sure you'd have preferred your old world.

08:44.930 --> 08:50.500
Yeah, since we're students, we can't
drink bubbly and get drunk here.

08:50.500 --> 08:52.510
That's a fatal flaw.

08:52.830 --> 08:53.690
Yup.

08:53.690 --> 08:55.720
You two...

08:56.360 --> 09:01.230
There are also a few other reasons
the other world's more fun.

09:01.230 --> 09:01.930
Disgusting.

09:02.850 --> 09:06.190
Wait, Ram! How did you know
about the succubus service?!

09:06.190 --> 09:06.940
Kazuma?

09:06.940 --> 09:07.300
Gulp!

09:07.300 --> 09:08.470
What are you talking about?

09:08.470 --> 09:10.270
Nothing!

09:10.830 --> 09:13.220
Anyway, as for whether we go back or not,

09:13.220 --> 09:15.960
I'll leave that up to all of you.

09:17.390 --> 09:18.330
I see.

09:19.210 --> 09:21.490
Subaru, what about you?

09:24.370 --> 09:27.470
Our world's in dire straits, too.

09:27.470 --> 09:31.820
I've lost count of the time 
I've coughed up my own blood.

09:32.300 --> 09:34.180
It wasn't a harem story?

09:34.180 --> 09:36.500
It's complicated, okay?

09:38.340 --> 09:44.730
And I'm pretty sure if we go back, 
it's only gonna get worse.

09:45.610 --> 09:49.590
But I do want to go home.

09:50.730 --> 09:55.320
To make Emilia ruler, to grant her wish,

09:55.320 --> 09:58.920
I have to go back!

09:55.750 --> 09:56.820
Sheesh.

09:59.060 --> 10:00.240
Subaru.

10:01.470 --> 10:03.990
You're an impressive guy.

10:03.990 --> 10:08.790
There's other stuff I had to do, but sorry.

10:08.790 --> 10:11.660
My memories are all a mess and
I can't figure out how to say it.

10:11.660 --> 10:13.570
A bugged transfer?

10:13.570 --> 10:14.730
Ains-sama?

10:14.730 --> 10:16.370
No, nothing.

10:16.820 --> 10:20.440
So? What about you, Ains?

10:21.090 --> 10:24.600
Do you want to go back?

10:24.600 --> 10:26.390
Hm...

10:26.750 --> 10:28.350
Coming to this world...

10:29.960 --> 10:31.190
I've realized...

10:32.700 --> 10:38.370
I've realized any place can be better
than you think, after meeting you guys.

10:38.750 --> 10:40.750
What's gotten into you?

10:40.750 --> 10:42.450
Sounds like the last episode.

10:42.450 --> 10:45.810
Look forward to Ains-sensei's
next original manga!

10:45.810 --> 10:46.910
Quiet.

10:48.830 --> 10:50.820
I don't care which.

10:51.540 --> 10:54.200
If Subaru wants to go home,

10:54.940 --> 10:58.020
then let's win the music festival for him.

10:58.710 --> 10:59.930
I see.

11:00.300 --> 11:01.670
Then let's do that.

11:03.710 --> 11:06.660
Then let's do a chorus, too!

11:07.250 --> 11:09.350
Wh-What are you saying, Natsuki-san?

11:09.350 --> 11:12.370
There's only a week till the festival!

11:12.370 --> 11:14.470
Why don't we give it a try?

11:14.470 --> 11:16.830
It's in the Order of Axis's teachings, right?

11:16.830 --> 11:20.040
Better to regret what you do than
regret what you don't, or something?

11:20.040 --> 11:22.230
Wait, that's totally wrong!

11:21.220 --> 11:23.260
You're so smart, Subaru-kun!

11:23.260 --> 11:24.320
Totally wrong!

11:26.780 --> 11:32.120
All right, so Class 2 will be doing
songs and playing instruments!

11:32.120 --> 11:35.800
There's only one week till the big day.

11:35.800 --> 11:37.800
But let's do our best!

11:38.100 --> 11:39.720
Yeah!
